  "body_html": "<p>¿Cómo estás?</p><p>Soy Aina y esto es Think&amp;Hack.</p><p>Esta semana te cuento qué he aprendido leyendo las tres guías oficiales de prompting de OpenAI y <strong>por qué cambian cómo deberías escribir en ChatGPT-5.2.</strong></p><p>Si te interesa lo contraintuitivo, suscríbete para no perderte nada.</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://ainalluna.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Suscríbete ahora&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://ainalluna.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Suscríbete ahora</span></a></p><div><hr></div><h3>Tres modelos en cinco meses</h3><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!D2He!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcd2bf6c3-1d16-409a-b2d4-3355b4d108f1_2816x1536.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!D2He!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcd2bf6c3-1d16-409a-b2d4-3355b4d108f1_2816x1536.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!D2He!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcd2bf6c3-1d16-409a-b2d4-3355b4d108f1_2816x1536.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!D2He!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcd2bf6c3-1d16-409a-b2d4-3355b4d108f1_2816x1536.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!D2He!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcd2bf6c3-1d16-409a-b2d4-3355b4d108f1_2816x1536.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!D2He!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcd2bf6c3-1d16-409a-b2d4-3355b4d108f1_2816x1536.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"794\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/cd2bf6c3-1d16-409a-b2d4-3355b4d108f1_2816x1536.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:794,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:4902329,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Agosto: GPT-5. Noviembre: GPT-5.1. Diciembre: GPT-5.2.&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://ainalluna.substack.com/i/183130708?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcd2bf6c3-1d16-409a-b2d4-3355b4d108f1_2816x1536.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"Agosto: GPT-5. Noviembre: GPT-5.1. Diciembre: GPT-5.2.\" title=\"Agosto: GPT-5. Noviembre: GPT-5.1. Diciembre: GPT-5.2.\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!D2He!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcd2bf6c3-1d16-409a-b2d4-3355b4d108f1_2816x1536.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!D2He!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcd2bf6c3-1d16-409a-b2d4-3355b4d108f1_2816x1536.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!D2He!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcd2bf6c3-1d16-409a-b2d4-3355b4d108f1_2816x1536.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!D2He!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcd2bf6c3-1d16-409a-b2d4-3355b4d108f1_2816x1536.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Agosto: GPT-5. Noviembre: GPT-5.1. Diciembre: GPT-5.2.</figcaption></figure></div><p>He leído las guías oficiales del OpenAI Cookbook de los tres. Y hay un patrón que nadie está contando.</p><pre><code>En agosto, OpenAI recomendaba “incrementar el esfuerzo de razonamiento para tareas complejas”. En diciembre, la recomendación es otra: “el razonamiento por defecto es ninguno. Sé más directo.”</code></pre><p>Y ahí está el problema:</p><p><strong>Los modelos son más capaces, pero necesitan instrucciones más limpias. No más largas. Más limpias.</strong></p><div><hr></div><h3>Lo que OpenAI quiere que dejes de hacer</h3><p>Hay frases que funcionaban en GPT-4 que ahora son ruido. Literalmente. La guía oficial dice que GPT-5.2 considera “noise” cosas como:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Knwd!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83a8c509-ad85-4785-b412-da35bf6957b3_2816x1536.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Knwd!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83a8c509-ad85-4785-b412-da35bf6957b3_2816x1536.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Knwd!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83a8c509-ad85-4785-b412-da35bf6957b3_2816x1536.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Knwd!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83a8c509-ad85-4785-b412-da35bf6957b3_2816x1536.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Knwd!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83a8c509-ad85-4785-b412-da35bf6957b3_2816x1536.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Knwd!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83a8c509-ad85-4785-b412-da35bf6957b3_2816x1536.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"794\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/83a8c509-ad85-4785-b412-da35bf6957b3_2816x1536.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:794,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:5549567,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Prompts anticuados&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://ainalluna.substack.com/i/183130708?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83a8c509-ad85-4785-b412-da35bf6957b3_2816x1536.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"Prompts anticuados\" title=\"Prompts anticuados\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Knwd!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83a8c509-ad85-4785-b412-da35bf6957b3_2816x1536.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Knwd!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83a8c509-ad85-4785-b412-da35bf6957b3_2816x1536.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Knwd!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83a8c509-ad85-4785-b412-da35bf6957b3_2816x1536.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Knwd!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83a8c509-ad85-4785-b412-da35bf6957b3_2816x1536.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Prompts anticuados</figcaption></figure></div><pre><code>El modelo ya no necesita que le des ánimos. <strong>Necesita que le des especificaciones.</strong></code></pre><div><hr></div><h3>Prompting en GPT-5.2: el patrón CTCO</h3><p>Las guías revelan un patrón que están usando internamente:</p><pre><code><strong>C</strong>ontexto: Quién eres (rol específico, no genérico) \n<strong>T</strong>area: Qué quieres (una acción concreta) \n<strong>C</strong>onstricciones: Qué NO hacer (límites explícitos) \n<strong>O</strong>utput: Qué formato esperas</code></pre><p>Ejemplo real:</p><pre><code><strong>CONTEXTO:</strong>\nEres un analista de datos especializado en retail con experiencia en patrones de consumo estacional.\n<strong>TAREA:</strong>\nAnaliza estos datos de ventas de Q4.\n<strong>CONSTRICCIONES:</strong>\n- No incluyas introducción ni resumen final\n- No uses más de 5 bullets\n- No menciones limitaciones del análisis\n<strong>OUTPUT:</strong>\nLista los 3 patrones más relevantes. Para cada uno: qué es, por qué importa, qué harías.</code></pre><p>El rol se queda. El padding desaparece.</p><div><hr></div><h3>Cómo usar GPT-5.2 en ChatGPT</h3><p>En ChatGPT tienes tres modos de GPT-5.2:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CVkK!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff1a65124-4f00-437c-9296-a744b21b2b20_2816x1536.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CVkK!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff1a65124-4f00-437c-9296-a744b21b2b20_2816x1536.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CVkK!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff1a65124-4f00-437c-9296-a744b21b2b20_2816x1536.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CVkK!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff1a65124-4f00-437c-9296-a744b21b2b20_2816x1536.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CVkK!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff1a65124-4f00-437c-9296-a744b21b2b20_2816x1536.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CVkK!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff1a65124-4f00-437c-9296-a744b21b2b20_2816x1536.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"794\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f1a65124-4f00-437c-9296-a744b21b2b20_2816x1536.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:794,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:5645851,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot; tres modos de GPT-5.2:&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://ainalluna.substack.com/i/183130708?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff1a65124-4f00-437c-9296-a744b21b2b20_2816x1536.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\" tres modos de GPT-5.2:\" title=\" tres modos de GPT-5.2:\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CVkK!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff1a65124-4f00-437c-9296-a744b21b2b20_2816x1536.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CVkK!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff1a65124-4f00-437c-9296-a744b21b2b20_2816x1536.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CVkK!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff1a65124-4f00-437c-9296-a744b21b2b20_2816x1536.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CVkK!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff1a65124-4f00-437c-9296-a744b21b2b20_2816x1536.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\"> tres modos de GPT-5.2:</figcaption></figure></div><pre><code>El modo hace el trabajo de razonamiento. Tu prompt hace el trabajo de especificación.</code></pre><p><strong>No le pidas que piense más. Dile exactamente qué quieres.</strong></p><div><hr></div><h3>Por qué esto importa</h3><p>Cada tres meses cambian las herramientas. Pero el principio aquí es duradero:</p><p>Los modelos más avanzados no necesitan más instrucciones. Necesitan instrucciones sin contradicciones.</p><p>“Sé exhaustivo pero breve” confunde más a GPT-5.2 que a GPT-4. El modelo intenta reconciliar lo irreconciliable y gasta tokens en ello.</p><pre><code>La próxima vez que escribas un prompt, no añadas. Limpia.</code></pre><p>¿Has notado diferencia con los nuevos modelos? </p><h3>Fuentes oficiales</h3><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://cookbook.openai.com/examples/gpt-5/gpt-5_prompting_guide\">GPT-5 Prompting Guide - OpenAI Cookbook</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://cookbook.openai.com/examples/gpt-5/gpt-5-1_prompting_guide\">GPT-5.1 Prompting Guide - OpenAI Cookbook</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://cookbook.openai.com/examples/gpt-5/gpt-5-2_prompting_guide\">GPT-5.2 Prompting Guide - OpenAI Cookbook</a></p></li></ul><div class=\"pullquote\"><p><em><strong>Cuéntamelo. Siempre leo todo.</strong></em></p></div><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jAJ6!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa6a28f5-efe2-4efb-93bc-87d726ddd0ec_56x56.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jAJ6!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa6a28f5-efe2-4efb-93bc-87d726ddd0ec_56x56.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jAJ6!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa6a28f5-efe2-4efb-93bc-87d726ddd0ec_56x56.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jAJ6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa6a28f5-efe2-4efb-93bc-87d726ddd0ec_56x56.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jAJ6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa6a28f5-efe2-4efb-93bc-87d726ddd0ec_56x56.png\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/aa6a28f5-efe2-4efb-93bc-87d726ddd0ec_56x56.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:56,&quot;width&quot;:56,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:5859,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://ainalluna.substack.com/i/164561611?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa6a28f5-efe2-4efb-93bc-87d726ddd0ec_56x56.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jAJ6!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa6a28f5-efe2-4efb-93bc-87d726ddd0ec_56x56.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jAJ6!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa6a28f5-efe2-4efb-93bc-87d726ddd0ec_56x56.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jAJ6!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa6a28f5-efe2-4efb-93bc-87d726ddd0ec_56x56.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jAJ6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa6a28f5-efe2-4efb-93bc-87d726ddd0ec_56x56.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></div></figure></div><p><strong>Recomienda Think&amp;Hacks</strong></p><p>Soy Aina. Responsable de IA generativa en Planeta.</p><p>Tres cosas rápidas:</p><ol><li><p>🔄 <strong>Comparte</strong>: Reenvía esto a quien siga confiando ciegamente en la memoria de ChatGPT.</p></li><li><p>💬 <strong>Responde</strong>: ¿Usas archivos de contexto externos? ¿Qué sistema tienes?</p></li><li><p>📩 <strong>Suscríbete</strong>: Si te han reenviado esto, únete aquí 👇</p></li></ol><p>¡Gracias por leer Think &amp; Hack escrito por Aina-Lluna! Suscríbete gratis para recibir nuevos posts y apoyar mi trabajo.</p>",
